       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. IMMCICS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COMMUNICATION-AREA PIC X.
       COPY BNK1MAI.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO BNK1MEO.
           IF EIBCALEN = 1 AND EIBAID = LOW-VALUES AND
              EIBTRNID = 'ODCS' AND COBCICS-COMMAREA(1:1) = 'I'
               MOVE 'COBOL IMMEDIATE ODCS' TO MESSAGEO
           ELSE
               MOVE 'BAD IMMEDIATE CONTEXT' TO MESSAGEO
           END-IF.
           EXEC CICS SEND MAP('BNK1ME')
             MAPSET('BNK1MAI') FROM(BNK1MEO)
             ERASE FREEKB END-EXEC.
           MOVE 'I' TO COMMUNICATION-AREA.
           EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('OMEN')
             COMMAREA(COMMUNICATION-AREA) LENGTH(1)
           END-EXEC.
